; UNSEEN May 16 - Nov 13 2026, at the backtest's costs (assumed 10 USD spread, no commission): this setup 47 trades, PF 2.35, net +12.1R; the 3 setups of this combination together 121 trades, PF 2.14 (stressed 1.64).
; EARLIER DATA, before the calibration period: 2024: this setup 85 trades, PF 1.44; 2023: this setup 65 trades, PF 0.51. The combination together: 2024 PF 1.10 (214 trades); 2023 PF 0.60 (187 trades). The 2026 result did NOT hold on earlier data: UNPROVEN, demo and Strategy Tester only.
